      ],
      "source": "https://www.lakesnwoods.com/Scanlon.htm",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office operated in Scanlon’s general store from 1901 to 1954, reflecting the town’s early commercial hub.",
